			"Message": "build(Project): Extend Turborepo pipeline with new build targets and synchronize Element submodule\n\nAdd four new pipeline targets to turbo.json: BrowserProxy, Electron, Mountain, and Bundle. These new targets expand the Land workspace build orchestration to support additional compilation and bundling workflows.\n\nSynchronize the Element submodule with three coordinated commits:\n- Fix language provider registration between Cocoon and Mountain by aligning provider selector formats and adding language inference fallback\n- Replace hand-written VS Code type shims with centralized @codeeditorland/output re-exports across Cocoon, Wind, and other components\n- Standardize Sky workbench URL paths from package specifiers to runtime /vs/ paths with dynamic imports\n\nThis coordinated update extends the build pipeline while resolving the broken language feature IPC chain and eliminating duplicate shim implementations.",
			"SHA": "a792f914897d1b40557c7c447c6403599a54d179"
		},
